# Working Principle

## 📌 Overview

The Smart Irrigation Monitoring System continuously monitors soil moisture, temperature, and humidity using sensors connected to the ESP32.

Based on the soil moisture condition, the ESP32 controls the irrigation pump through a relay.

---

## ⚙️ Working Process

```text
Soil Moisture Sensor
        ↓
      ESP32
        ↓
Decision Based on Moisture
        ↓
   Relay Module
        ↓
    Water Pump
        ↓
    Irrigation

